1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,350
In this lesson, we'll open a contact and
look at everything Kyntlo knows about

2
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:08,459
them: their details, their
timeline, notes, tasks,

3
00:00:08,459 --> 00:00:11,009
appointments and Do Not Disturb settings.

4
00:00:11,862 --> 00:00:14,235
From your contact list, click any name.

5
00:00:14,235 --> 00:00:19,347
Let's open Olivia Bennett, a new Invisalign
lead who found us through a Facebook ad.

6
00:00:20,197 --> 00:00:22,463
A contact record has three columns.

7
00:00:22,463 --> 00:00:24,276
On the left are her details.

8
00:00:24,276 --> 00:00:27,319
In the middle is her
activity and conversation.

9
00:00:27,319 --> 00:00:31,850
And on the right are her opportunities,
appointments, tasks and notes.

10
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:35,073
Every field on the left can be edited.

11
00:00:35,073 --> 00:00:40,007
Click a field, make your change, and a
Save button appears at the bottom of the

12
00:00:40,007 --> 00:00:40,381
panel.

13
00:00:40,381 --> 00:00:43,816
Here, I'll add the company
Olivia works for, then save.

14
00:00:44,668 --> 00:00:46,859
The middle column is her timeline.

15
00:00:46,859 --> 00:00:50,919
Every message, booking, tag and
change is logged here in order,

16
00:00:50,919 --> 00:00:56,333
so anyone on your team can catch up in
seconds, even if they've never spoken to her.

17
00:00:56,333 --> 00:00:59,491
Switch to Conversations
to see just her messages.

18
00:01:00,342 --> 00:01:02,614
You can reply right from the record.

19
00:01:02,614 --> 00:01:05,958
Choose the channel, type
your message and click Send.

20
00:01:05,958 --> 00:01:10,879
Her reply comes back into this same
thread, and into your Conversations inbox.

21
00:01:10,879 --> 00:01:14,160
She asked about Thursday,
so let's offer her a time.

22
00:01:14,986 --> 00:01:18,553
On the right, notes are for
anything your team should remember.

23
00:01:18,553 --> 00:01:21,440
Click the plus next to
Notes, type it in, and save.

24
00:01:22,573 --> 00:01:25,627
Tasks are reminders with
a due date and an owner.

25
00:01:25,627 --> 00:01:29,928
Let's remind ourselves to call Olivia
tomorrow if she hasn't replied.

26
00:01:29,928 --> 00:01:33,231
Tasks show up on your
dashboard and in the Tasks tab,

27
00:01:33,231 --> 00:01:35,475
so nothing slips through the cracks.

28
00:01:36,325 --> 00:01:38,653
You can book appointments from here too.

29
00:01:38,653 --> 00:01:42,612
Click the plus next to Appointments,
choose the calendar and a time,

30
00:01:42,612 --> 00:01:44,707
and Kyntlo sends her a confirmation.

31
00:01:46,323 --> 00:01:50,379
At the top on the right, opportunities
show the deals linked to her,

32
00:01:50,379 --> 00:01:51,990
with their stage and value.

33
00:01:51,990 --> 00:01:54,316
Click one to see where the deal stands.

34
00:01:54,316 --> 00:01:56,404
We'll dig into those in module six.

35
00:01:57,254 --> 00:02:00,715
Finally, scroll down the
left side to Do Not Disturb.

36
00:02:00,715 --> 00:02:05,614
If someone asks you to stop messaging
them, switch on DND for that channel,

37
00:02:05,614 --> 00:02:07,508
or for every channel at once.

38
00:02:08,358 --> 00:02:11,848
With DND on, Kyntlo blocks
messages on those channels,

39
00:02:11,848 --> 00:02:14,886
including ones from
automations and bulk sends.

40
00:02:14,886 --> 00:02:20,121
It's how you respect people's wishes and
stay on the right side of privacy rules.

41
00:02:20,121 --> 00:02:23,999
Olivia is happy to hear from
us, so I'll switch it back off.

42
00:02:24,850 --> 00:02:25,886
Here's a pro tip.

43
00:02:25,886 --> 00:02:29,236
After every phone call, take
ten seconds to add a note.

44
00:02:29,236 --> 00:02:32,466
When a colleague picks up
the conversation next week,

45
00:02:32,466 --> 00:02:34,903
they'll know exactly where things stand,

46
00:02:34,903 --> 00:02:37,888
and your customer never
has to repeat themselves.

47
00:02:38,740 --> 00:02:40,412
That's the contact record!

48
00:02:40,412 --> 00:02:44,141
Next, we'll look at tags,
custom fields and custom values,

49
00:02:44,141 --> 00:02:48,706
the three tools that make your
automations and messages truly personal.

50
00:02:48,706 --> 00:02:49,607
See you there.
